   "pin": null,
   "question": "Will the QML GUI treat SUBMISSION_SKIPPED with -walletbroadcast=0 as saved rather than failure?",
   "quote": "Will the QML GUI treat that as \"saved, not broadcast\" rather than as a failure?",
   "request": "",
   "status": "answered",
   "status_by": {
    "at": "2026-10-22",
    "by": "pseudoramdom",
    "id": "c:6347331724",
    "quote": "Yes, that's the intent. `SUBMISSION_SKIPPED` is a separate code precisely so a caller can differentiate"
   },
   "status_note": "author confirmed that SUBMISSION_SKIPPED is intended to allow callers to differentiate skipped submissions from rejections",
